OL,3,ANvidia value climbs by almost $1tn and 
OL,4,Atech stocks rally after Jensen Huang   
OL,5,Areturns                                
OL,7,FNvidia's market value rose by nearly $1
OL,8,Ftrillion as its share price skyrocketed
OL,9,Fafter the tech firm reinstated Jensen  
OL,10,FHuang as its chief executive with      
OL,11,Fimmediate effect.                      
OL,13,FHis shock reinstatement comes less than
OL,14,Ftwo weeks after Huang resigned after   
OL,15,Fadmitting an affair with a woman who   
OL,16,Fwas alleged to be a Chinese spy, a     
OL,17,Fperiod in which shares in the chipmaker
OL,18,Fhave also fallen significantly.        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
