OL,3,ANvidia value climbs by almost $1tn and 
OL,4,Atech stocks rally after Jensen Huang   
OL,5,Areturns                                
OL,7,FNvidia shares rose by more than 31%    
OL,8,Fwhich also lifted stock markets, with  
OL,9,Fthe tech-heavy Nasdaq climbing by 6.5% 
OL,10,Fand the S&P 500 also rose 4.75%.       
OL,12,FTech stocks more broadly have also     
OL,13,Frallied following large falls on       
OL,14,FFriday, with much of the rally starting
OL,15,Fin pre-market trading before Huang's   
OL,16,Freturn was announced.                  
